'''Serum''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event|Merc Storia]] collaboration event. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 115
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Serum
|name2 = Serum CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Serum CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Serum is similar to [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] in the fact that many [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] enemies like [[Gory Dark]] or [[Shadow Boxer K]] already have many knockbacks, so knocking them back more won't help.

She can be used to knockback [[Le'noir]], [[Dark Otter]] or [[Director Kurosawah]], but even for this limited usage, [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and/or [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Assassin BearCat]] all outclass her in some way or another. Unfortunately, due to these factors, there is little to no usage for Serum in the game.

